# This repo gets edited from both Windows and WSL. Without a rule here, whichever
# side saved a file last decides its line endings, so files flip between CRLF and
# LF and show up as whole-file diffs containing no actual change. Store and check
# out LF everywhere so a diff only ever shows real edits.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch these: line-ending translation corrupts them.
*.gif binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
